## Authentication & security

All auto-update POST routes accept either:
1. `Authorization: Bearer $CRON_SECRET` (Vercel cron passes this automatically)
2. Authenticated user session (admin manual trigger via browser/curl)

**Never expose CRON_SECRET in client code or logs.**

Pattern used in all cron-capable routes:
```ts
const isCron = process.env.CRON_SECRET && authHeader === `Bearer ${process.env.CRON_SECRET}`;
if (!isCron) {
  const session = await auth();
  if (!session?.user?.id) return NextResponse.json({ error: "Unauthorized" }, { status: 401 });
}
```

