## File index for auto-update system

```
src/
  app/api/
    data/sync/route.ts              ← Process 1: market quotes cron route
    admin/update-index/route.ts     ← Process 2: VN30/VN100 index cron route + monitoring GET
  lib/
    providers/
      tcbs.ts                       ← TCBS company overview + index composition APIs
      vndirect.ts                   ← VNDirect fundamentals (existing)
      entrade.ts                    ← Entrade quotes (existing)
    stock-ai-classifier.ts          ← Process 3: DB → TCBS → LLM ladder + DB save
    stock-metadata.ts               ← lookupIndexStock (JSON), lookupIndexStockFromDB (DB), clearMetaCache
    market-service.ts               ← enrichStockDetails() calls classifier when sector = "Unknown"

vercel.json                         ← cron schedules for processes 1 + 2
```
